PDFlight
========

Source material
---------------

The publications compiled by this project are works of the United States
Government, produced by the Federal Aviation Administration and the National
Transportation Safety Board. Under 17 U.S.C. 105 they are not subject to
copyright protection in the United States. They are reproduced here unaltered.

PDFlight adds no original content. No summaries, no mnemonics, no annotations.
The compilation consists of the source documents, generated navigation pages,
and a link layer connecting them.


This is not an official FAA product
-----------------------------------

PDFlight is an unofficial compilation. It is not produced, reviewed, endorsed,
or approved by the Federal Aviation Administration or by any other agency of
the United States Government. No agency has verified its accuracy or currency.

Do not rely on this document for operational or legal purposes. Verify against
the official FAA sources before acting on anything in it. Every included
document carries its revision and currency date, and the colophon lists the
source and retrieval date for each one.

Regulatory text is reproduced from the Electronic Code of Federal Regulations.
The eCFR is an editorial compilation and is not the official legal edition of
the Code of Federal Regulations.

Legal interpretations issued by the FAA Office of the Chief Counsel respond to
the specific facts presented by the person who requested them. They are not
regulations and do not necessarily apply to other circumstances.


Trademarks and third-party material
-----------------------------------

PDFlight is not affiliated with any commercial provider of aviation reference
material and does not reuse any such provider's taxonomy, menu structure, or
naming.

No manufacturer avionics documentation, pilot operating handbook, or other
non-government material is included or redistributed.


